   'The FDA cefepime label documents the class: "Aminoglycosides: increased potential of nephrotoxicity and ototoxicity. Monitor renal function" (7.2). Tobramycin, used mainly against Pseudomonas, is combined with cefepime in severe infections — additive renal and auditory risk.',
