   'Cefepima + estreptomicina: risco aumentado de nefrotoxicidade e ototoxicidade — monitorizar a função renal.',
   'Cefepime + streptomycin: increased risk of nephrotoxicity and ototoxicity — monitor renal function.',
   'O rótulo FDA da cefepima documenta a classe: "Aminoglycosides: increased potential of nephrotoxicity and ototoxicity. Monitor renal function" (7.2). A estreptomicina é o aminoglicosídeo clássico — a associação com cefepima (ex.: em endocardite por Streptococcus) tem risco renal e auditivo aditivo.',
   'The FDA cefepime label documents the class: "Aminoglycosides: increased potential of nephrotoxicity and ototoxicity. Monitor renal function" (7.2). Streptomycin is the classic aminoglycoside — combining with cefepime (e.g., in Streptococcus endocarditis) carries additive renal and auditory risk.',
