   'DailyMed/FDA (NIH/NLM) — rótulo aprovado Cefepima (WG CRITICAL CARE), secção 7.2: https://dailymed.nlm.nih.gov/dailymed/drugInfo.cfm?setid=5fd857e5-591f-44ca-80cf-fd903660b03c ; rótulo aprovado Estreptomicina: https://dailymed.nlm.nih.gov/dailymed/drugInfo.cfm?setid=78982c98-7866-49f1-989f-a289c4242358',
   'DailyMed/FDA (NIH/NLM) — approved Cefepime label (WG CRITICAL CARE), section 7.2: https://dailymed.nlm.nih.gov/dailymed/drugInfo.cfm?setid=5fd857e5-591f-44ca-80cf-fd903660b03c ; approved Streptomycin label: https://dailymed.nlm.nih.gov/dailymed/drugInfo.cfm?setid=78982c98-7866-49f1-989f-a289c4242358', 'published', now()),

  -- Cefepima × Furosemida (rótulo FDA 7.3)
  (LEAST((SELECT id FROM public.drugs WHERE slug = 'cefepima'),
        (SELECT id FROM public.drugs WHERE slug = 'furosemida')),
   GREATEST((SELECT id FROM public.drugs WHERE slug = 'cefepima'),
            (SELECT id FROM public.drugs WHERE slug = 'furosemida')),
   'moderate',
   'Cefepima + furosemida: nefrotoxicidade reportada com diuréticos potentes — monitorizar a função renal.',
   'Cefepime + furosemide: nephrotoxicity reported with potent diuretics — monitor renal function.',
   'O rótulo FDA da cefepima documenta: "Diuretics: nephrotoxicity has been reported following concomitant administration of other cephalosporins with potent diuretics such as furosemide. Monitor renal function" (7.3). O mecanismo é multifatorial (depleção volémica, interferência na autorregulação renal) e relevante sobretudo no doente idoso e no internado.',
   'The FDA cefepime label documents: "Diuretics: nephrotoxicity has been reported following concomitant administration of other cephalosporins with potent diuretics such as furosemide. Monitor renal function" (7.3). The mechanism is multifactorial (volume depletion, interference with renal autoregulation) and relevant mainly in the elderly and inpatients.',
   'Monitorizar a função renal (creatinina, débito urinário) durante a associação, sobretudo no idoso.',
   'Monitor renal function (creatinine, urine output) during the combination, especially in the elderly.',
   'Vigiar eletrólitos e hidratação do doente.',
   'Monitor electrolytes and patient hydration.',
   'Aumento da creatinina ou oligúria em doente a receber cefepima e furosemida.',
   'Rising creatinine or oliguria in a patient receiving cefepime and furosemide.',
   'DailyMed/FDA (NIH/NLM) — rótulo aprovado Cefepima (WG CRITICAL CARE), secção 7.3: https://dailymed.nlm.nih.gov/dailymed/drugInfo.cfm?setid=5fd857e5-591f-44ca-80cf-fd903660b03c ; rótulo aprovado Furosemida: https://dailymed.nlm.nih.gov/dailymed/drugInfo.cfm?setid=5886e233-b2da-4acb-be05-9bf40fb8e7f4',
   'DailyMed/FDA (NIH/NLM) — approved Cefepime label (WG CRITICAL CARE), section 7.3: https://dailymed.nlm.nih.gov/dailymed/drugInfo.cfm?setid=5fd857e5-591f-44ca-80cf-fd903660b03c ; approved Furosemide label: https://dailymed.nlm.nih.gov/dailymed/drugInfo.cfm?setid=5886e233-b2da-4acb-be05-9bf40fb8e7f4', 'published', now()),

  -- Cefotaxima × Probenecida (prontuário 1.1.2)
  (LEAST((SELECT id FROM public.drugs WHERE slug = 'cefotaxima'),
        (SELECT id FROM public.drugs WHERE slug = 'probenecida')),
   GREATEST((SELECT id FROM public.drugs WHERE slug = 'cefotaxima'),
            (SELECT id FROM public.drugs WHERE slug = 'probenecida')),
   'moderate',
   'Cefotaxima + probenecida: a probenecida inibe a secreção tubular das cefalosporinas — eleva as concentrações séricas.',
   'Cefotaxime + probenecid: probenecid inhibits cephalosporin tubular secretion — raises serum concentrations.',
   'O Prontuário Terapêutico documenta na introdução das cefalosporinas (1.1.2): "A probenecida inibe competitivamente a secreção tubular da maioria das cefalosporinas causando um aumento significativo das suas concentrações séricas". A cefotaxima é excretada por secreção tubular — a probenecida eleva e prolonga as suas concentrações.',
   'The Prontuário Terapêutico documents in the cephalosporin introduction (1.1.2): "Probenecid competitively inhibits the tubular secretion of most cephalosporins, causing a significant increase in their serum concentrations". Cefotaxime is excreted by tubular secretion — probenecid raises and prolongs its concentrations.',
   'Evitar a associação; se a probenecida for essencial, considerar redução da dose da cefotaxima.',
   'Avoid the combination; if probenecid is essential, consider reducing the cefotaxime dose.',
   'Vigiar sinais de toxicidade se a associação for usada.',
   'Monitor for signs of toxicity if the combination is used.',
   'Efeitos adversos aumentados ou neurotoxicidade com a associação.',
   'Increased adverse effects or neurotoxicity with the combination.',
   'Prontuário Terapêutico do INFARMED (11.ª ed., 2012) — Cefalosporinas, 1.1.2 ; rótulo aprovado Probenecida (MARLEX): https://dailymed.nlm.nih.gov/dailymed/drugInfo.cfm?setid=5d552de5-2d18-4464-bcaf-0311fa3f080d',
   'Prontuário Terapêutico do INFARMED (11th ed., 2012) — Cephalosporins, 1.1.2 ; approved Probenecid label (MARLEX): https://dailymed.nlm.nih.gov/dailymed/drugInfo.cfm?setid=5d552de5-2d18-4464-bcaf-0311fa3f080d', 'published', now()),

  -- Cefuroxima × Levonorgestrel (rótulo FDA 7.1 — contracetivos orais)
  (LEAST((SELECT id FROM public.drugs WHERE slug = 'cefuroxima'),
        (SELECT id FROM public.drugs WHERE slug = 'levonorgestrel')),
   GREATEST((SELECT id FROM public.drugs WHERE slug = 'cefuroxima'),
            (SELECT id FROM public.drugs WHERE slug = 'levonorgestrel')),
   'moderate',
   'Cefuroxima + contracetivos orais: efeitos na flora intestinal podem reduzir a eficácia contracetiva.',
   'Cefuroxime + oral contraceptives: effects on gut flora may reduce contraceptive efficacy.',
   'O rótulo FDA da cefuroxima documenta: "Oral Contraceptives: Effects on gut flora may lower estrogen reabsorption and reduce efficacy of oral contraceptives" (7.1). Os antibióticos de largo espectro podem alterar a flora intestinal e reduzir a reabsorção de estrogénios, comprometendo a fiabilidade contracetiva.',
   'The FDA cefuroxime label documents: "Oral Contraceptives: Effects on gut flora may lower estrogen reabsorption and reduce efficacy of oral contraceptives" (7.1). Broad-spectrum antibiotics may alter gut flora and reduce oestrogen reabsorption, compromising contraceptive reliability.',
   'Advertir as utilizadoras de contracetivos orais para o risco reduzido de eficácia durante e até 7 dias após a antibioterapia; considerar método de barreira adicional.',
   'Advise users of oral contraceptives about the reduced efficacy risk during and up to 7 days after antibiotic therapy; consider an additional barrier method.',
   'Vigiar spotting/hemorragia intermenstrual como sinal de possível perda de eficácia.',
   'Watch for spotting/breakthrough bleeding as a sign of possible loss of efficacy.',
   'Hemorragia intermenstrual ou gravidez não planeada durante antibioterapia com cefuroxima.',
   'Breakthrough bleeding or unplanned pregnancy during cefuroxime antibiotic therapy.',
   'DailyMed/FDA (NIH/NLM) — rótulo aprovado Cefuroxima axetil (WOCKHARDT), secção 7.1: https://dailymed.nlm.nih.gov/dailymed/drugInfo.cfm?setid=708b7a4d-ba1f-47b5-be4d-a01c2a7017ff ; rótulo aprovado Levonorgestrel: https://dailymed.nlm.nih.gov/dailymed/drugInfo.cfm?setid=07567b80-d8a1-41c0-95e4-33afa584bbc4',
   'DailyMed/FDA (NIH/NLM) — approved Cefuroxime axetil label (WOCKHARDT), section 7.1: https://dailymed.nlm.nih.gov/dailymed/drugInfo.cfm?setid=708b7a4d-ba1f-47b5-be4d-a01c2a7017ff ; approved Levonorgestrel label: https://dailymed.nlm.nih.gov/dailymed/drugInfo.cfm?setid=07567b80-d8a1-41c0-95e4-33afa584bbc4', 'published', now()),

  -- Cefuroxima × Antiácidos (rótulo FDA 7.2)
  (LEAST((SELECT id FROM public.drugs WHERE slug = 'cefuroxima'),
        (SELECT id FROM public.drugs WHERE slug = 'antiacidos')),
   GREATEST((SELECT id FROM public.drugs WHERE slug = 'cefuroxima'),
            (SELECT id FROM public.drugs WHERE slug = 'antiacidos')),
   'moderate',
   'Cefuroxima + antiácidos: os antiácidos reduzem a biodisponibilidade da cefuroxima axetil oral.',
   'Cefuroxime + antacids: antacids reduce the bioavailability of oral cefuroxime axetil.',
   'O rótulo FDA da cefuroxima documenta: "Drugs that reduce gastric acidity may lower the bioavailability of cefuroxime axetil tablets" (7.2). A cefuroxima axetil oral necessita de pH gástrico ácido para a sua absorção; os antiácidos reduzem essa absorção e podem comprometer a eficácia antibiótica.',
   'The FDA cefuroxime label documents: "Drugs that reduce gastric acidity may lower the bioavailability of cefuroxime axetil tablets" (7.2). Oral cefuroxime axetil requires an acidic gastric pH for absorption; antacids reduce that absorption and may compromise antibiotic efficacy.',
   'Separar a toma da cefuroxima oral dos antiácidos por 2-3 horas.',
   'Separate oral cefuroxime from antacids by 2-3 hours.',
   'Avaliar a resposta clínica à antibioterapia durante a associação.',
   'Assess clinical response to antibiotic therapy during the combination.',
   'Falência terapêutica da antibioterapia com toma simultânea de antiácidos.',
   'Therapeutic failure of antibiotic therapy with simultaneous antacid intake.',
   'DailyMed/FDA (NIH/NLM) — rótulo aprovado Cefuroxima axetil (WOCKHARDT), secção 7.2: https://dailymed.nlm.nih.gov/dailymed/drugInfo.cfm?setid=708b7a4d-ba1f-47b5-be4d-a01c2a7017ff ; rótulo aprovado Antiácidos: https://dailymed.nlm.nih.gov/dailymed/drugInfo.cfm?setid=0a13ac81-0c63-48c1-bbb0-f6e67f97b896',
   'DailyMed/FDA (NIH/NLM) — approved Cefuroxime axetil label (WOCKHARDT), section 7.2: https://dailymed.nlm.nih.gov/dailymed/drugInfo.cfm?setid=708b7a4d-ba1f-47b5-be4d-a01c2a7017ff ; approved Antacids label: https://dailymed.nlm.nih.gov/dailymed/drugInfo.cfm?setid=0a13ac81-0c63-48c1-bbb0-f6e67f97b896', 'published', now()),

  -- Cefuroxima × Probenecida (rótulo FDA 7.3)
  (LEAST((SELECT id FROM public.drugs WHERE slug = 'cefuroxima'),
