   'moderate',
   'Famotidina + tizanidina: a famotidina pode aumentar substancialmente as concentrações de tizanidina (CYP1A2) — evitar, se possível.',
   'Famotidine + tizanidine: famotidine may substantially increase tizanidine concentrations (CYP1A2) — avoid if possible.',
   'O rótulo FDA da famotidina documenta: "Tizanidine (CYP1A2) Substrate: Potential for substantial increases in blood concentrations of tizanidine resulting in hypotension, bradycardia or excessive drowsiness; avoid concomitant use, if possible" (7.2). A famotidina inibe o CYP1A2, reduzindo o metabolismo da tizanidina.',
   'The FDA famotidine label documents: "Tizanidine (CYP1A2) Substrate: Potential for substantial increases in blood concentrations of tizanidine resulting in hypotension, bradycardia or excessive drowsiness; avoid concomitant use, if possible" (7.2). Famotidine inhibits CYP1A2, reducing tizanidine metabolism.',
   'Evitar a associação; se inevitável, reduzir a dose de tizanidina e vigiar hipotensão, bradicardia e sedação.',
   'Avoid the combination; if unavoidable, reduce the tizanidine dose and monitor for hypotension, bradycardia and sedation.',
   'Monitorizar tensão arterial, frequência cardíaca e nível de sedação no início da associação.',
   'Monitor blood pressure, heart rate and level of sedation at the start of the combination.',
   'Hipotensão ortostática, bradicardia ou sedação excessiva com a associação.',
   'Orthostatic hypotension, bradycardia or excessive sedation with the combination.',
   'DailyMed/FDA (NIH/NLM) — rótulo aprovado Famotidina (TEVA), secção 7.2: https://dailymed.nlm.nih.gov/dailymed/drugInfo.cfm?setid=4c6f4f9e-f3f5-4ecf-9f40-887e037e8847 ; rótulo aprovado Tizanidina (PREFERRED PHARMACEUTICALS): https://dailymed.nlm.nih.gov/dailymed/drugInfo.cfm?setid=8d0b2b22-e1df-4ad5-92e6-f9a369108e4b',
   'DailyMed/FDA (NIH/NLM) — approved Famotidine label (TEVA), section 7.2: https://dailymed.nlm.nih.gov/dailymed/drugInfo.cfm?setid=4c6f4f9e-f3f5-4ecf-9f40-887e037e8847 ; approved Tizanidine label (PREFERRED PHARMACEUTICALS): https://dailymed.nlm.nih.gov/dailymed/drugInfo.cfm?setid=8d0b2b22-e1df-4ad5-92e6-f9a369108e4b', 'published', now()),

  -- Fenoximetilpenicilina × Probenecida (prontuário 1.1.1.1)
  (LEAST((SELECT id FROM public.drugs WHERE slug = 'fenoximetilpenicilina'),
