   'moderate',
   'Fenoximetilpenicilina + probenecida: a probenecida inibe a secreção tubular das penicilinas — eleva as concentrações séricas.',
   'Phenoxymethylpenicillin + probenecid: probenecid inhibits penicillin tubular secretion — raises serum concentrations.',
   'O Prontuário Terapêutico documenta na monografia da fenoximetilpenicilina (1.1.1.1): "A probenecida inibe competitivamente a secreção tubular das penicilinas causando um aumento significativo das suas concentrações séricas". Historicamente a probenecida era usada como adjuvante para prolongar os níveis das penicilinas — hoje a associação não é recomendada por rotina.',
   'The Prontuário Terapêutico documents in the phenoxymethylpenicillin monograph (1.1.1.1): "Probenecid competitively inhibits the tubular secretion of penicillins, causing a significant increase in their serum concentrations". Historically probenecid was used as an adjuvant to prolong penicillin levels — today the combination is not routinely recommended.',
   'Evitar a associação por rotina; se a probenecida for usada como adjuvante (ex.: indicações específicas), monitorizar toxicidade.',
   'Avoid routine combination; if probenecid is used as an adjuvant (e.g., specific indications), monitor for toxicity.',
   'Vigiar sinais de toxicidade se a associação for usada.',
   'Monitor for signs of toxicity if the combination is used.',
   'Efeitos adversos aumentados com a associação.',
   'Increased adverse effects with the combination.',
   'Prontuário Terapêutico do INFARMED (11.ª ed., 2012) — Fenoximetilpenicilina, 1.1.1.1 ; rótulo aprovado Probenecida (MARLEX): https://dailymed.nlm.nih.gov/dailymed/drugInfo.cfm?setid=5d552de5-2d18-4464-bcaf-0311fa3f080d',
   'Prontuário Terapêutico do INFARMED (11th ed., 2012) — Phenoxymethylpenicillin, 1.1.1.1 ; approved Probenecid label (MARLEX): https://dailymed.nlm.nih.gov/dailymed/drugInfo.cfm?setid=5d552de5-2d18-4464-bcaf-0311fa3f080d', 'published', now()),

  -- Fondaparinux × Warfarina (rótulo FDA 7)
  (LEAST((SELECT id FROM public.drugs WHERE slug = 'fondaparinux'),
        (SELECT id FROM public.drugs WHERE slug = 'warfarina')),
   GREATEST((SELECT id FROM public.drugs WHERE slug = 'fondaparinux'),
            (SELECT id FROM public.drugs WHERE slug = 'warfarina')),
   'moderate',
   'Fondaparinux + warfarina: risco aumentado de hemorragia — monitorizar de perto se a associação for necessária.',
   'Fondaparinux + warfarin: increased bleeding risk — monitor closely if the combination is needed.',
   'O rótulo FDA do fondaparinux documenta: "Agents that may enhance the risk of hemorrhage should be discontinued prior to initiation of therapy with fondaparinux sodium unless these agents are essential. If co-administration is necessary, monitor patients closely for hemorrhage" (7). A warfarina, anticoagulante oral, aumenta o risco hemorrágico aditivo com o fondaparinux.',
   'The FDA fondaparinux label documents: "Agents that may enhance the risk of hemorrhage should be discontinued prior to initiation of therapy with fondaparinux sodium unless these agents are essential. If co-administration is necessary, monitor patients closely for hemorrhage" (7). Warfarin, an oral anticoagulant, adds bleeding risk with fondaparinux.',
   'Suspender os agentes que aumentam o risco hemorrágico antes de iniciar o fondaparinux, salvo se essenciais; se a associação for necessária, monitorizar de perto.',
   'Discontinue agents that increase bleeding risk before starting fondaparinux unless essential; if the combination is necessary, monitor closely.',
   'Monitorizar hemorragias (clínicas e laboratoriais — hemoglobina, plaquetas) e o INR durante a sobreposição.',
   'Monitor for bleeding (clinical and laboratory — haemoglobin, platelets) and INR during overlap.',
   'Hemorragia ativa, queda da hemoglobina ou equimoses espontâneas durante a associação.',
   'Active bleeding, falling haemoglobin or spontaneous bruising during the combination.',
   'DailyMed/FDA (NIH/NLM) — rótulo aprovado Fondaparinux (ZYDUS), secção 7: https://dailymed.nlm.nih.gov/dailymed/drugInfo.cfm?setid=dffbf7c9-495e-4a33-ac76-57b52f014fc2 ; rótulo aprovado Warfarina: https://dailymed.nlm.nih.gov/dailymed/drugInfo.cfm?setid=541c9a70-adaf-4ef3-94ba-ad4e70dfa057',
   'DailyMed/FDA (NIH/NLM) — approved Fondaparinux label (ZYDUS), section 7: https://dailymed.nlm.nih.gov/dailymed/drugInfo.cfm?setid=dffbf7c9-495e-4a33-ac76-57b52f014fc2 ; approved Warfarin label: https://dailymed.nlm.nih.gov/dailymed/drugInfo.cfm?setid=541c9a70-adaf-4ef3-94ba-ad4e70dfa057', 'published', now()),

  -- Fondaparinux × Aspirina (rótulo FDA 7)
  (LEAST((SELECT id FROM public.drugs WHERE slug = 'fondaparinux'),
