            (SELECT id FROM public.drugs WHERE slug = 'aspirina')),
   'moderate',
   'Fondaparinux + aspirina: risco aumentado de hemorragia — monitorizar de perto se a associação for necessária.',
   'Fondaparinux + aspirin: increased bleeding risk — monitor closely if the combination is needed.',
   'O rótulo FDA do fondaparinux documenta que os inibidores plaquetários (ácido acetilsalicílico) não afetam a farmacocinética do fondaparinux, mas "Agents that may enhance the risk of hemorrhage should be discontinued prior to initiation of therapy with fondaparinux sodium unless these agents are essential" (7). A aspirina, antiagregante plaquetário, aumenta o risco hemorrágico aditivo.',
   'The FDA fondaparinux label documents that platelet inhibitors (acetylsalicylic acid) do not affect fondaparinux pharmacokinetics, but "Agents that may enhance the risk of hemorrhage should be discontinued prior to initiation of therapy with fondaparinux sodium unless these agents are essential" (7). Aspirin, a platelet inhibitor, adds bleeding risk.',
