   'Discontinue aspirin before starting fondaparinux unless essential; if the combination is necessary, monitor closely.',
   'Monitorizar hemorragias (clínicas e laboratoriais) durante a associação.',
   'Monitor for bleeding (clinical and laboratory) during the combination.',
   'Hemorragia ativa ou queda da hemoglobina durante a associação.',
   'Active bleeding or falling haemoglobin during the combination.',
   'DailyMed/FDA (NIH/NLM) — rótulo aprovado Fondaparinux (ZYDUS), secção 7: https://dailymed.nlm.nih.gov/dailymed/drugInfo.cfm?setid=dffbf7c9-495e-4a33-ac76-57b52f014fc2 ; rótulo aprovado Ácido acetilsalicílico: https://dailymed.nlm.nih.gov/dailymed/drugInfo.cfm?setid=a454cd24-0c6d-46e8-b1e4-197388606175',
   'DailyMed/FDA (NIH/NLM) — approved Fondaparinux label (ZYDUS), section 7: https://dailymed.nlm.nih.gov/dailymed/drugInfo.cfm?setid=dffbf7c9-495e-4a33-ac76-57b52f014fc2 ; approved Acetylsalicylic acid label: https://dailymed.nlm.nih.gov/dailymed/drugInfo.cfm?setid=a454cd24-0c6d-46e8-b1e4-197388606175', 'published', now()),

  -- Fondaparinux × Diclofenac (rótulo FDA 7 — AINEs)
  (LEAST((SELECT id FROM public.drugs WHERE slug = 'fondaparinux'),
        (SELECT id FROM public.drugs WHERE slug = 'diclofenac')),
   GREATEST((SELECT id FROM public.drugs WHERE slug = 'fondaparinux'),
            (SELECT id FROM public.drugs WHERE slug = 'diclofenac')),
   'moderate',
   'Fondaparinux + diclofenac: risco aumentado de hemorragia (AINE) — monitorizar de perto.',
   'Fondaparinux + diclofenac: increased bleeding risk (NSAID) — monitor closely.',
   'O rótulo FDA do fondaparinux documenta que os AINEs (ex.: piroxicam nos estudos) não afetam a farmacocinética do fondaparinux, mas "Agents that may enhance the risk of hemorrhage should be discontinued prior to initiation of therapy with fondaparinux sodium unless these agents are essential" (7). Os AINEs, como o diclofenac, aumentam o risco hemorrágico por inibição plaquetária e irritação gastrointestinal.',
   'The FDA fondaparinux label documents that NSAIDs (e.g., piroxicam in studies) do not affect fondaparinux pharmacokinetics, but "Agents that may enhance the risk of hemorrhage should be discontinued prior to initiation of therapy with fondaparinux sodium unless these agents are essential" (7). NSAIDs such as diclofenac increase bleeding risk through platelet inhibition and gastrointestinal irritation.',
   'Suspender os AINEs antes de iniciar o fondaparinux, salvo se essenciais; se a associação for necessária, monitorizar de perto.',
   'Discontinue NSAIDs before starting fondaparinux unless essential; if the combination is necessary, monitor closely.',
   'Monitorizar hemorragias e sintomas gastrointestinais durante a associação.',
   'Monitor for bleeding and gastrointestinal symptoms during the combination.',
   'Hemorragia ativa, melenas ou dor abdominal com a associação.',
   'Active bleeding, melaena or abdominal pain with the combination.',
   'DailyMed/FDA (NIH/NLM) — rótulo aprovado Fondaparinux (ZYDUS), secção 7: https://dailymed.nlm.nih.gov/dailymed/drugInfo.cfm?setid=dffbf7c9-495e-4a33-ac76-57b52f014fc2 ; rótulo aprovado Diclofenac: https://dailymed.nlm.nih.gov/dailymed/drugInfo.cfm?setid=ddd2278b-70be-41ca-8a84-e3fe0f1a1561',
   'DailyMed/FDA (NIH/NLM) — approved Fondaparinux label (ZYDUS), section 7: https://dailymed.nlm.nih.gov/dailymed/drugInfo.cfm?setid=dffbf7c9-495e-4a33-ac76-57b52f014fc2 ; approved Diclofenac label: https://dailymed.nlm.nih.gov/dailymed/drugInfo.cfm?setid=ddd2278b-70be-41ca-8a84-e3fe0f1a1561', 'published', now()),

