   'moderate',
   'Memantina + dextrometorfano: antagonistas NMDA em associação — usar com precaução.',
   'Memantine + dextromethorphan: NMDA antagonists in combination — use with caution.',
   'O rótulo FDA da memantina documenta: "Use with other NMDA antagonists (amantadine, ketamine, and dextromethorphan) has not been systematically evaluated and such use should be approached with caution" (7.1). O dextrometorfano e a memantina são ambos antagonistas NMDA — a associação pode potenciar efeitos adversos do SNC.',
   'The FDA memantine label documents: "Use with other NMDA antagonists (amantadine, ketamine, and dextromethorphan) has not been systematically evaluated and such use should be approached with caution" (7.1). Dextromethorphan and memantine are both NMDA antagonists — the combination may potentiate CNS adverse effects.',
   'Usar com precaução; vigiar sedação, confusão e efeitos no SNC na associação.',
   'Use with caution; monitor sedation, confusion and CNS effects in the combination.',
   'Vigiar alterações do estado mental e sedação.',
   'Monitor mental status changes and sedation.',
   'Sedação excessiva, confusão ou alucinações com a associação.',
   'Excessive sedation, confusion or hallucinations with the combination.',
   'DailyMed/FDA (NIH/NLM) — rótulo aprovado Memantina (NAMENDA XR), secção 7.1: https://dailymed.nlm.nih.gov/dailymed/drugInfo.cfm?setid=617dcd31-3215-4dd8-9b6e-d888d3bf30f3 ; rótulo aprovado Dextrometorfano: https://dailymed.nlm.nih.gov/dailymed/drugInfo.cfm?setid=0d99237c-0b52-0af6-e063-6394a90aba14',
   'DailyMed/FDA (NIH/NLM) — approved Memantine label (NAMENDA XR), section 7.1: https://dailymed.nlm.nih.gov/dailymed/drugInfo.cfm?setid=617dcd31-3215-4dd8-9b6e-d888d3bf30f3 ; approved Dextromethorphan label: https://dailymed.nlm.nih.gov/dailymed/drugInfo.cfm?setid=0d99237c-0b52-0af6-e063-6394a90aba14', 'published', now()),

