   'The Prontuário Terapêutico documents in the memantine monograph: "Possibility of potentiating the anticoagulant effect of warfarin". The mechanism is not fully clarified — INR monitoring is recommended when the combination is started or changed.',
   'Monitorizar o INR após iniciar, ajustar ou suspender a memantina em doentes anticoagulados com warfarina.',
