   'DailyMed/FDA (NIH/NLM) — approved Tafenoquine label (ARAKODA, 60 DEGREES PHARMACEUTICALS), section 7.1: https://dailymed.nlm.nih.gov/dailymed/drugInfo.cfm?setid=299e49d8-470f-4779-a010-4a1ee0e0c6cd ; approved Metformin label: https://dailymed.nlm.nih.gov/dailymed/drugInfo.cfm?setid=34496b43-05a2-45fb-a769-52b12e099341', 'published', now())

